 4 files changed, 236 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0171-PCI-host-common-Let-only-the-endpoints-decide-about-.patch
 create mode 100644 device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0172-bus-mhi-host-pci_generic-Make-the-flashless-SDX55-a-.patch
